{"format":1,"id":"freundlich_mit_mir","kurz":"fm","sprache":"de","richtung":"ltr","titel":"Freundlich mit mir selbst","untertitel":"In einem schweren Moment freundlich mit sich sprechen, wie mit einem guten Freund.","haltung":["sitzen","liegen"],"augen":"zu_oder_offen","ende":"glocke","schlaf_modus":false,"laengen":{"kurz":{"ziel_s":180},"normal":{"ziel_s":600},"lang":{"ziel_s":900}},"kb":959,"abschnitte":[{"id":"ankommen","segmente":[{"id":"s001","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/1.e899dbbc.mp3","ms":3162,"text":"Setz dich bequem hin, oder leg dich hin.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s002","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/2.4e1c7317.mp3","ms":5786,"text":"Schließ die Augen, wenn du magst. Du kannst jederzeit aufhören.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s003","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/3.45ec587e.mp3","ms":5422,"text":"Spür, wie du sitzt oder liegst. Lass die Schultern sinken.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s004","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/4.c3fead7b.mp3","ms":3011,"text":"Atme ein paarmal ruhig ein und aus.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}}]},{"id":"situation","segmente":[{"id":"s005","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/5.b73d8050.mp3","ms":7760,"text":"Denk an eine Situation, die dich gerade beschäftigt. Etwas, das ein bisschen schwer ist.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s006","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/6.e7114da3.mp3","ms":4762,"text":"Nimm nicht das Schwerste. Etwas Mittleres reicht.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s007","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/7.45d93926.mp3","ms":7118,"text":"Stell dir die Situation kurz vor. Wo bist du? Was ist passiert?","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s008","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/8.2cb5e1b5.mp3","ms":7664,"text":"Spür nach, wo du das im Körper merkst. Vielleicht im Bauch, in der Brust oder im Hals.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st01","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":27.7,"normal":52.8,"lang":60.5}},{"id":"s009","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/9.a105743f.mp3","ms":4867,"text":"Wenn es zu viel wird, öffne die Augen und spür deine Füße am Boden.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}}]},{"id":"bemerken","segmente":[{"id":"s010","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/10.58f25ab7.mp3","ms":3695,"text":"Sag dir jetzt innerlich: Das ist gerade schwer.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s011","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/11.5d032f3c.mp3","ms":5697,"text":"Oder mit deinen eigenen Worten: Das tut weh. Das stresst mich.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}}]},{"id":"nicht_allein","segmente":[{"id":"s012","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/12.010552bb.mp3","ms":6196,"text":"Und dann: So etwas erleben viele Menschen. Ich bin damit nicht allein.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s013","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/13.f52dd5c6.mp3","ms":3642,"text":"Andere fühlen sich in so einer Lage ganz ähnlich.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"st02","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":52.8,"lang":60.5}}]},{"id":"freundlich","segmente":[{"id":"s014","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/14.479e1498.mp3","ms":5383,"text":"Wenn du magst, leg eine Hand aufs Herz, auf den Bauch oder an die Wange.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s015","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/15.fe7a41f2.mp3","ms":2127,"text":"Spür die Wärme deiner Hand.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s016","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/16.1c262187.mp3","ms":5842,"text":"Und frag dich: Was würde ich jetzt einem guten Freund sagen, dem es so geht wie mir?","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"s017","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/17.8d5cb5a2.mp3","ms":6212,"text":"Vielleicht: Du gibst dir Mühe. Oder: Das darf jetzt schwer sein.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s018","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/18.3dc080fb.mp3","ms":5288,"text":"Sag dir diese Worte jetzt selbst. In einem warmen Ton.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st03","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":27.7,"normal":52.8,"lang":60.5}},{"id":"s019","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/19.40db4a34.mp3","ms":6241,"text":"Es muss sich nicht sofort gut anfühlen. Es geht um die freundliche Absicht.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s020","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/20.25be187a.mp3","ms":6089,"text":"Wiederhol die Worte, so oft du magst. Langsam und freundlich.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st04","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":52.8,"lang":60.5}},{"id":"s021","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/21.d549f027.mp3","ms":8257,"text":"Spür, ob sich im Körper etwas verändert. Oder auch nicht. Beides ist in Ordnung.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st05","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":52.8,"lang":60.5}},{"id":"s022","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/22.bbc092e7.mp3","ms":7485,"text":"Wenn es dir schwerfällt, freundlich zu dir zu sein, ist das in Ordnung. Viele kennen das.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":8}},{"id":"s023","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/23.849e94de.mp3","ms":5189,"text":"Dann stell dir vor, ein Mensch, der dich mag, sagt diese Worte zu dir.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":13}},{"id":"st06","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":60.5}}]},{"id":"satz","segmente":[{"id":"s024","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/24.476bcfa0.mp3","ms":8116,"text":"Such dir einen kurzen Satz, den du mitnehmen kannst. Einen, der stimmt und nicht übertrieben ist.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s025","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/25.74e7c4b9.mp3","ms":4065,"text":"Zum Beispiel: Ich darf Fehler machen und daraus lernen.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s026","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/26.20d349c0.mp3","ms":2091,"text":"Oder: Ich stehe zu mir.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st07","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":52.8,"lang":60.5}},{"id":"s027","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/27.e739d13e.mp3","ms":4822,"text":"Sag dir deinen Satz noch ein paarmal, im Rhythmus des Atems.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st08","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":60.5}}]},{"id":"rueckkehr","segmente":[{"id":"s028","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/28.a955ced8.mp3","ms":2428,"text":"Lass die Situation jetzt los.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s029","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/29.40576fe5.mp3","ms":4180,"text":"Spür wieder deinen Atem, und wie du sitzt oder liegst.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s030","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/30.a9a448c1.mp3","ms":2572,"text":"Atme einmal tief ein und aus.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s031","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/31.7948e2ab.mp3","ms":2912,"text":"Öffne die Augen, wenn du so weit bist.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s032","art":"sprache","datei":"fm/32.768f1b23.mp3","ms":3534,"text":"Wenn du gelegen hast, steh langsam auf.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2,"lang":3}},{"id":"glocke","art":"glocke","ton":"ende"}]}]}